  "excerpt": "Installing openssh-server, hardening sshd_config against brute-force attacks, disabling root login, and verifying remote connections with SSH clients.",
  "tags": ["linux", "ssh", "seguridad", "sysadmin", "redes", "archivo-2020"],
  "coverImage": "/images/blog/aso/image79.png",
  "content": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "blockquote",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Historical and archival note: This article is part of a laboratory series originally developed on November 23, 2020, for the Operating Systems Architecture course at Universidad Nacional de Ingeniería (UNI), Managua. It is preserved for educational and historical reference, integrating updated technical notes on modern Linux and networking standards."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "1. Installing and Configuring OpenSSH Server"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "We update repositories and install the openssh-server package:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "codeBlock",
        "attrs": {
          "language": "bash"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "sudo apt-get update\nsudo apt-get install openssh-server\nsudo gedit /etc/ssh/sshd_config"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "attrs": {
          "src": "/images/blog/aso/image75.png",
          "alt": "Apertura de sshd_config",
          "title": "Apertura de sshd_config"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "2. Defensive Hardening Parameters"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Aplicamos los ajustes de endurecimiento en 'sshd_config':"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Descomentar Port 22."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Ajustar LoginGraceTime a un tiempo prudencial."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Descomentar PermitRootLogin y establecerlo en 'no'."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Descomentar StrictModes y fijarlo en 'yes'."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Añadir directiva AllowUsers con el nombre del usuario autorizado."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Descomentar MaxAuthTries fijándolo en 5 intentos."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Descomentar MaxStartups fijándolo en 5."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "attrs": {
          "src": "/images/blog/aso/image76.png",
          "alt": "Parámetros defensivos configurados en sshd_config",
          "title": "Parámetros defensivos configurados en sshd_config"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Guardamos los cambios, reiniciamos el servicio y verificamos que esté activo:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "codeBlock",
        "attrs": {
          "language": "bash"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "sudo service ssh restart\nsudo service ssh status"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "attrs": {
          "src": "/images/blog/aso/image77.png",
          "alt": "Estado activo de OpenSSH",
          "title": "Estado activo de OpenSSH"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "3. Verifying Connections from Remote Clients (PuTTY)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Descargamos e iniciamos PuTTY en el cliente, introduciendo la dirección IP del servidor y el puerto configurado:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "attrs": {
          "src": "/images/blog/aso/image78.png",
          "alt": "Configuración de sesión en PuTTY",
          "title": "Configuración de sesión en PuTTY"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Iniciamos la sesión e ingresamos las credenciales autorizadas en la consola remota:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "attrs": {
          "src": "/images/blog/aso/image79.png",
          "alt": "Sesión remota SSH establecida con éxito",
          "title": "Sesión remota SSH establecida con éxito"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Con esto se verifica el canal cifrado remoto, completando la suite de servicios de infraestructura del laboratorio."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
